			"date": "2025-06-06T15:56:21.992Z",
			"content": "<p>The thing is this is really dangerous once those in power no longer follow previously established values of society.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:clni6g4jifkpo4crjqgee47c/app.bsky.feed.post/3lqxa3xpb5k2l",
