			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukas.grebe.me/post/3lqxa3xpb5k2l",
			"author": {
				"name": "Lukas",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/lukas.grebe.me",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:clni6g4jifkpo4crjqgee47c/bafkreifnypxumxrpyg4k6j7vyhproksc5tgusg5cx2chmodb3wex7py6ly"
			},
			"date": "2025-06-06T16:13:47.687Z",
			"content": "<p>Imagine a hypothetical fascist regime coming to power, tracking messages or websites visited by dissidents. It could quickly identify and suppress them—through threats like deportation—before any legal process could intervene, as fascism involves the forcible silencing of opposition.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
